Bonsai 2 vLLM plugin
Copyright 2026 Bonsai 2 vLLM plugin contributors.

This project implements an out-of-tree adapter for vLLM and uses its Apache-2.0
licensed Qwen3.5 model implementation. The pinned Prism llama.cpp GGUF reader
is a separate dependency under its upstream license.

The separately distributed model is derived from Ternary Bonsai 2 by Prism ML,
itself derived from Qwen3.8-27B by Alibaba Cloud. Their license and attribution
notices accompany the Hugging Face model. Created using Bonsai by Prism ML.

The optional DFlash2 checkpoint is provided by ProCreations and is downloaded
separately with its own upstream license and notice.
